om/OceanRamen/Brainstorm/) focused on working with every content mod out there by dynamic resolution of new content. It also optimizes the seed finding without the help of [Immolate](https://github.com/SpectralPack/Immolate)\n\n### Default Keybinds\n- Save state to slot 1-5: hold `Z` and press `1-5` (or hold `1-5` then press `Z`)\n- Load state from slot 1-5: hold `X` and press `1-5` (or hold `1-5` then press `X`)\n- Fast reroll: `Ctrl + T`\n- Toggle auto-reroll: `Ctrl + A`\n- Stop active auto-reroll search: `Ctrl + P`\n\n### Features\n- Save states\n- Fast reroll\n- Auto-reroll with configurable filters\n- Extended game speed options\n- Dynamic detection of new/custom tags,packs,vouchers and legendary joke","downloads":0,"updated_at":1773949251,"download_url":"https://github.com/alexgot1151/Brainstorm-Enhanced/releases/download/release/mod.zip"},{"id":"ABGamma@Brainstorm-Rerolled","dir_name":"ABGamma@Brainstorm-Rerolled","name":"Brainstorm-Rerolled","title":"Brainstorm-Rerolled","author":"OceanRamen and ABGamma","repo":"https://github.com/ABGamma/Brainstorm-Rerolled/","homepage":"https://github.com/ABGamma/Brainstorm-Rerolled/","folder_name":"Brainstorm-Rerolled","version":"Brainstorm-Rerolled-1.0.2-alpha","categories":["Content","Technical","Miscellaneous"],"requires_steamodded":false,"requires_talisman":false,"summary":"# Brainstorm Rerolled\nThis is a fork of both [Brainstorm](https://github.com/OceanRamen/Brainstorm) created by [OceanRamen](https://github.com/OceanRamen) as well as [Immolate](https://github.com/SpectralPack/Immolate) please give credit to them as I have simply modified the hard work they did\n\n# /!\\ Not compatible with macOS /!\\\n\n## Description\nThis repository houses both the code for the brainstorm mod as well as the code for the C++ version of the Immolate seed finder. If you would like to create your own filters simply \nadd the code to the Immolate.cpp file, update the brainstorm endpoints to include whatever you need and then build it. This will generate a dll\nthat you can then place in the mods folder of balatro. The brainstorm mod will automatically detect the dll and use it, though","description":"# Brainstorm Rerolled\nThis is a fork of both [Brainstorm](https://github.com/OceanRamen/Brainstorm) created by [OceanRamen](https://github.com/OceanRamen) as well as [Immolate](https://github.com/SpectralPack/Immolate) please give credit to them as I have simply modified the hard work they did\n\n# /!\\ Not compatible with macOS /!\\\n\n## Description\nThis repository houses both the code for the brainstorm mod as well as the code for the C++ version of the Immolate seed finder. If you would like to create your own filters simply \nadd the code to the Immolate.cpp file, update the brainstorm endpoints to include whatever you need and then build it. This will generate a dll\nthat you can then place in the mods folder of balatro. The brainstorm mod will automatically detect the dll and use it, though","downloads":0,"updated_at":1767287568,"download_url":"https://github.com/ABGamma/Brainstorm-Rerolled/releases/latest/download/Brainstorm-Rerolled.zip"},{"id":"PinkMaggit@Buffoonery","dir_name":"PinkMaggit@Buffoonery","name":"Buffoonery","title":"Buffoonery","author":"PinkMaggit","repo":"https://github.com/pinkmaggit-hub/Buffoonery","homepage":"https://github.com/pinkmaggit-hub/Buffoonery","folder_name":"","version":"67e9cf4","categories":["Content"],"requires_steamodded":true,"requires_talisman":false,"summary":"# Buffoonery\nA Vanilla-adjacent content mod for the hit roguelike deckbuilder, Balatro.\n\n**Requires Steamodded ALPHA 1.0.0-1315b or newer and Talisman**\n\n## Content\nCurrently, 24 Jokers, 2 Enhancements, 3 Decks, 3 Sleeves (requiring Larswijn's CardSleeves), 1 Tarot and a new rarity.\n### Mechanics\nSpecial rarity: 3 jokers from this mod are Special. They don't show up in the collection (configurable) and are unobtainable, unless you meet specific criteria. For now, that means using a deck